# "Loses all abilities" applies at the Aura's timestamp (CR 613.7, 613.1f): an ability the creature gains after it is kept.
# Bot1 enchants its own Ornithopter (flying gone, a 1/1), then casts Revitalizing Repast on it: the +1/+1 counter makes it
# 2/2 and "it gains indestructible until end of turn" is a later effect, so it has indestructible. The scenario that gives
# indestructible before the Aura shows it lost.

